codex
The real PRC integration had a second dead path: it keyed “current prototypes” by client/edge IDs while memory is keyed by class ID, so their intersection was normally empty and PRC returned zero. I’ve repaired that class-key aggregation and added counters at the actual memory, reliability, PRC, and dropout paths. Next I’m running CPU-only deterministic tests, including the guards.
